# Convex backend

- Every org-scoped query/mutation: authorize before data access (`requirePermission` / authz).
- Indexes first; bound `.take()` / pagination. Additive, intentional schema changes with `schema.ts`.
- Device ingest: credentialed, rate-limited, honest health/freshness transitions.
- Deterministic sorts when UI order matters (e.g. roster by last activity).
- Never log secrets, JWTs, device credentials, or raw auth headers.
- Demo/seed paths must not wipe or replace durable tenant data outside explicit staging tools.
- Cover authz, health, and ingest edge cases with convex/vitest when those paths change.
